00:21:22,560 --> 00:21:25,917
was he we know he's a cyborg
so he must have been a person

265
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:29,857
at some point but if this guy
isn't the real bartholomew

266
00:21:29,940 --> 00:21:33,797
kuma then why the heck does he
look just like him maybe the

267
00:21:33,880 --> 00:21:37,437
guy's got a twin if not they
must have modified the crap

268
00:21:37,520 --> 00:21:40,477
out of him to make him look
the same can't imagine why

269
00:21:40,560 --> 00:21:44,777
though he couldn't have been
created from scratch you can't

270
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:46,137
do that with a living person

271
00:21:46,220 --> 00:21:50,297
tx4

272
00:21:50,380 --> 00:21:54,757
we need to get some rest.

273
00:21:54,840 --> 00:21:58,340
I was up for a fight, but that
guy was way too much for me.

274
00:21:58,600 --> 00:21:59,640
I'm exhausted.

275
00:22:00,240 --> 00:22:04,200
A break would be nice, but we've
got to find a place to hide first.

276
00:22:04,560 --> 00:22:08,020
If they find us now, there's
no way we can fight them off.

277
00:22:08,960 --> 00:22:10,160
Yeah, I know.

278
00:22:10,340 --> 00:22:14,160
But let's just sit here for a few minutes.

279
00:22:16,340 --> 00:22:18,420
You guys got some real nerve.

280
00:22:18,660 --> 00:22:19,954
Look what you've done.

281
00:22:20,680 --> 00:22:23,100
What the? Another enemy? Where is he?

282
00:22:24,980 --> 00:22:27,440
There he is! Up there! Huh?

283
00:22:28,100 --> 00:22:29,440
House!

284
00:22:37,220 --> 00:22:38,360
Who are you?

285
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,080
I'm disgusted.

286
00:22:40,360 --> 00:22:42,660
You're an utter disgrace, PX4.

287
00:22:43,020 --> 00:22:44,940
The Navy's not made of money.

288
00:22:45,400 --> 00:22:49,576
Building just one of you pacifistas
costs as much as an entire warship.

289
00:22:51,640 --> 00:22:56,522
Seriously, you know how this is going to
look in my report to that lousy Vega Puck?

290
00:23:08,900 --> 00:23:10,959
Is that another one right with him?

291
00:23:11,220 --> 00:23:12,277
Are you kidding me?

292
00:23:12,360 --> 00:23:13,477
Is that the real one?

293
00:23:13,560 --> 00:23:15,977
Does it really matter if
it's the real one or not?

294
00:23:16,060 --> 00:23:18,497
We've already gotten a taste
of how strong the fakes are.

295
00:23:18,580 --> 00:23:21,051
We can't take another fight, not with him.

296
00:23:21,360 --> 00:23:23,060
Wait, pacifista?

297
00:23:24,340 --> 00:23:25,877
Yeah, that's what he called him.

298
00:23:25,960 --> 00:23:28,637
He didn't seem like much
of a pacifist, though.

299
00:23:28,720 --> 00:23:31,197
So, you think that's
his name or something?

300
00:23:31,280 --> 00:23:33,637
All right, axe boy, just
who the hell are you?

301
00:23:33,720 --> 00:23:36,297
I've got an identity
outside of my axe, you know.

302
00:23:36,380 --> 00:23:38,457
And there's no point in asking questions.

303
00:23:38,540 --> 00:23:40,364
I have no reason to answer you.

304
00:23:40,540 --> 00:23:43,437
I am the most well-guarded
and tight-lipped man alive.

305
00:23:43,520 --> 00:23:46,285
Nobody can break down my
impenetrable defenses.

306
00:23:46,800 --> 00:23:47,630
Oh, come on.

307
00:23:47,713 --> 00:23:49,397
You can at least tell us your name.

308
00:23:49,480 --> 00:23:52,068
Did you hear a single
thing I just told you?

309
00:23:52,420 --> 00:23:54,580
My lips are sealed. Trust me.

310
00:23:54,720 --> 00:23:57,357
There's not one person
more secretive than me.

311
00:23:57,440 --> 00:23:58,480
Saint Moria.

312
00:23:59,200 --> 00:24:00,030
Gotcha.

313
00:24:00,113 --> 00:24:01,120
So you're Saint Moria.

314
00:24:02,500 --> 00:24:05,180
Uh, to be clear, I
wanted you to know that.

315
00:24:05,340 --> 00:24:06,477
That's why I told you.

316
00:24:06,560 --> 00:24:08,972
And not because you wanted to know, okay?

317
00:24:10,160 --> 00:24:12,180
PX1, let's get started.

318
00:24:24,720 --> 00:24:27,757
Still no problems this
guy shoots beams from

319
00:24:27,840 --> 00:24:30,117
his hands too starting to
look like they've got a

320
00:24:30,200 --> 00:24:33,137
whole army of these guys
what is this crap i'm

321
00:24:33,220 --> 00:24:36,161
more concerned staying
alive the mystery can wait?

322
00:24:36,700 --> 00:24:40,957
We're too worn down there's just no way
we can make it through another fight!

323
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:44,140
When we haven't even met the admiral yeah.

324
00:24:49,600 --> 00:24:55,040
We can't win, let's run, but not
all together, we need to split up.

325
00:25:02,020 --> 00:25:03,860
Sounds good to me, run!

326
00:25:04,760 --> 00:25:07,577
We're the toughest, we'll
each lead our own group.

327
00:25:07,660 --> 00:25:10,072
Right, are you gonna be okay on your own?

328
00:25:10,160 --> 00:25:11,020
Hey, shut up!

329
00:25:11,540 --> 00:25:12,800
Wait up, Knife!

330
00:25:12,920 --> 00:25:14,391
We should stick together!

331
00:25:14,560 --> 00:25:19,077
I'll protect you no matter what, even
if it means sacrificing my life! Thanks!

332
00:25:19,160 --> 00:25:19,990
Thanks!

333
00:25:20,073 --> 00:25:20,920
Now, Red, faster!

334
00:25:21,180 --> 00:25:23,557
If you're really willing
to sacrifice yourself,

335
00:25:23,640 --> 00:25:25,577
why don't you hang back
and act as a decoy?

336
00:25:25,660 --> 00:25:27,800
It's a ladies-only offer, idiot.

337
00:25:28,040 --> 00:25:31,060
You can take care of your
own damn self, Panty Man.

338
00:25:36,900 --> 00:25:37,730
Dorry!

339
00:25:37,813 --> 00:25:38,643
Don't let me die!

340
00:25:38,740 --> 00:25:40,916
Protect me with all your might, okay?

341
00:25:41,020 --> 00:25:41,850
You suck!

342
00:25:41,933 --> 00:25:43,817
I'm already in enough pain as it is!

343
00:25:43,900 --> 00:25:45,017
Fret not, my friend.

344
00:25:45,100 --> 00:25:47,677
I'll proudly supply the
strength you currently lack.

345
00:25:47,760 --> 00:25:50,697
I can only imagine how much
healing you've left to do.

346
00:25:50,780 --> 00:25:53,837
I happened to witness your act
of selfless bravery on Thriller

347
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:57,214
Bark when you offered your
own life in place of Luffy's.

348
00:25:58,340 --> 00:25:59,480
All right. Thanks.

349
00:26:00,360 --> 00:26:02,480
Up there! Head that way! Got it.

350
00:26:02,720 --> 00:26:05,740
No more laser things! Hey! Guys!

351
00:26:05,980 --> 00:26:07,977
Meet back on the Sony in three days!

352
00:26:08,060 --> 00:26:09,417
They're splitting into groups!

353
00:26:09,500 --> 00:26:10,860
Go after them, Pucci!

354
00:26:11,020 --> 00:26:13,477
Make sure you don't let
him out of Grove 12.

355
00:26:13,560 --> 00:26:15,207
We don't need that headache.

356
00:26:15,440 --> 00:26:16,322
Special attack.

357
00:26:16,700 --> 00:26:17,780
Super Smoke Star.

358
00:26:21,160 --> 00:26:22,900
Now's our chance. Run for it.

359
00:26:23,620 --> 00:26:25,700
You really are quite dependable.

360
00:26:27,780 --> 00:26:29,220
He took out the bridge.

361
00:26:30,460 --> 00:26:31,480
Here he comes.

362
00:26:33,140 --> 00:26:33,970
No.

363
00:26:34,053 --> 00:26:35,017
Why is he apparized?

364
00:26:35,100 --> 00:26:37,982
Look, I don't know, but
will you quit pushing me?

365
00:26:38,320 --> 00:26:39,757
I should have to go to the house.

366
00:26:39,840 --> 00:26:40,800
He's over there.

367
00:26:41,020 --> 00:26:42,079
Are you guys okay?

368
00:26:43,900 --> 00:26:46,260
I'd worry about myself if I were you.

369
00:26:46,560 --> 00:26:49,977
I've got no grudge against you
pirates, but a job is a job.

370
00:26:50,060 --> 00:26:51,040
Now, come go!

371
00:26:52,300 --> 00:26:53,140
Got me!

372
00:26:56,880 --> 00:26:58,740
What the? What?

373
00:26:58,900 --> 00:27:00,197
How do you even do that?

374
00:27:00,280 --> 00:27:05,260
Your offensive skills are impressive,
but they're useless against my defense.

375
00:27:06,020 --> 00:27:08,060
Has she got a good point job?

376
00:27:09,260 --> 00:27:10,090
Luffy!

377
00:27:10,173 --> 00:27:11,640
Hopefully, this guy is strong!

378
00:27:12,400 --> 00:27:16,400
Just so you know, I don't
even have Devil Fruit powers!

379
00:27:17,860 --> 00:27:19,260
That makes it worse.

380
00:27:19,520 --> 00:27:21,100
Man, this is weird. Zoro!

381
00:27:31,860 --> 00:27:32,690
Who?

382
00:27:32,773 --> 00:27:33,603
Who are you?

383
00:27:33,686 --> 00:27:35,020
What are you? Whatever!

384
00:27:35,300 --> 00:27:37,300
Just get the hell away from Zoro!

385
00:27:38,060 --> 00:27:39,060
Oh, no, no, Zoro!

386
00:27:39,420 --> 00:27:41,920
He got hit by one of those laser beams!

387
00:27:42,300 --> 00:27:43,535
Hang in there, buddy!

388
00:27:43,700 --> 00:27:44,540
Come on!

389
00:27:45,580 --> 00:27:47,640
It's about time you got here.

390
00:27:47,840 --> 00:27:50,400
Took you long enough, Uncle Kizaru.

391
00:27:51,440 --> 00:27:53,740
Kizaru? Hey, Usopp! Be careful!

392
00:27:54,100 --> 00:27:55,629
That man's a Navy Admiral!

393
00:27:55,900 --> 00:27:57,100
An Admiral!

394
00:27:57,820 --> 00:27:58,650
Uh-oh!

395
00:27:59,980 --> 00:28:03,060
Your time is up, Pirate Hunter Zoro.

396
00:28:03,660 --> 00:28:09,280
Last I checked, you had 120 million bounty,
so this is not what I was expecting.

397
00:28:10,120 --> 00:28:15,140
Your reputation as a swordsman is known
far and wide, but one hit and you're down?

398
00:28:15,420 --> 00:28:17,360
That's a real shame, ain't it?

399
00:28:17,740 --> 00:28:20,080
You must be pretty worn out, hmm?

400
00:28:21,660 --> 00:28:22,490
Damn.

401
00:28:23,220 --> 00:28:24,840
They have not found us.

402
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:28,820
Well, you'll have plenty
of time to rest up now.

403
00:28:31,940 --> 00:28:32,770
Zoro!

404
00:28:42,660 --> 00:28:43,490
Zoro!

405
00:28:46,140 --> 00:28:46,970
Crap!

406
00:28:47,053 --> 00:28:47,996
He shoots beams too?

407
00:28:48,140 --> 00:28:50,434
How are we supposed to beat these guys?

408
00:28:50,520 --> 00:28:52,873
At point blank like that, he's done for!

409
00:28:53,740 --> 00:28:54,799
Zoro's in trouble!

410
00:28:55,000 --> 00:28:56,647
Come on, do something, guys!

411
00:29:07,500 --> 00:29:09,000
Get away from him!

412
00:29:09,220 --> 00:29:11,480
Back up or else! Take this!

413
00:29:13,420 --> 00:29:15,640
What? What the hell? Why?

414
00:29:15,860 --> 00:29:17,880
What is this? What's happening?

415
00:29:18,180 --> 00:29:19,121
I can't hit him!

416
00:29:22,900 --> 00:29:28,080
I can't stab him! What the?
What can we do? Trying! Dammit!

417
00:29:28,920 --> 00:29:31,060
Move your foot! I mean it!

418
00:29:31,280 --> 00:29:32,400
Leave him alone!

419
00:29:33,580 --> 00:29:35,540
Step away from our friend!

420
00:29:36,140 --> 00:29:37,760
You're wasting your time.

421
00:29:38,220 --> 00:29:41,396
I ate the glint glint fruit
and now I'm made of light.

422
00:29:41,700 --> 00:29:43,280
It's a Logia, you see.

423
00:29:43,880 --> 00:29:45,180
He's made of light?

424
00:29:45,440 --> 00:29:46,680
This is a nightmare.

425
00:29:46,980 --> 00:29:48,509
There's nothing we can do.

426
00:29:48,620 --> 00:29:49,450
Zoro!

427
00:29:49,533 --> 00:29:51,980
Try to run away! Hurry!

428
00:29:56,360 --> 00:29:57,600
I can't move.

429
00:29:58,080 --> 00:29:59,140
I'm too weak.

430
00:29:59,600 --> 00:30:00,560
It's no use.

431
00:30:00,700 --> 00:30:01,797
The bastard's worn out.

432
00:30:01,880 --> 00:30:02,710
He can't save himself.

433
00:30:02,793 --> 00:30:04,180
Now, Vantek, look!

434
00:30:09,200 --> 00:30:10,030
Yes!

435
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,376
Awesome work, Robin!

436
00:30:21,820 --> 00:30:25,120
He just shifted in place! Unbelievable!

437
00:30:28,840 --> 00:30:34,400
It's cute how your friends want to save
you, But you're far beyond help now.

438
00:30:37,680 --> 00:30:40,500
Well then, time to die.

439
00:30:56,900 --> 00:30:59,429
You picked some time
to come out of hiding.

440
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:04,720
You sure you want to do
this, Dark King Rayleigh?

441
00:31:05,500 --> 00:31:08,017
Don't go picking these
buds before they sprout.

442
00:31:08,100 --> 00:31:12,394
Their era is only just beginning, and
I want to see what they do with it.

443
00:31:15,260 --> 00:31:16,090
Rayleigh!

444
00:31:17,100 --> 00:31:18,940
The geezer saved Zoro!
